
## LLM API KEYS

# GEMINI
# 1. Visit https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# 2. Sign in with your Google account.
# 3. Create an API key and copy it below.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# GROQ
# 1. Create an account at https://console.groq.com/
# 2. Navigate to API Keys.
# 3. Generate an API key and copy it below.
GROQ_API_KEY=


## REDIS CONFIGURATION

# Use the SAME cloud Redis instance configured in the Node.js backend.
# Copy the hostname, port and password from the backend environment file.
# Do not create another Redis instance.
# Ensure TLS is configured in the application if required by your provider.
REDIS_HOST=
REDIS_PORT=
REDIS_PASSWORD=


## OAG FLIGHT DATA API

# 1. Register at https://developers.oag.com/
# 2. Subscribe to the Flight Info API.
# 3. Obtain your API subscription key from the developer portal.
# Note: API access may require a trial or paid subscription.
OAG_API_KEY=


## JINA API

# 1. Create an account at https://jina.ai/
# 2. Generate an API key from your account dashboard.
# 3. Copy the generated key below.
JINA_API_KEY=
